    "body": "One thing we try to do for backends that generate consistent output is to add a simple test that compares newly generated output with a \"golden\" reference. This can be a bit of a pain to maintain, but I expect we'll have \"autofix\" fix things up automatically in the near future. This helps if someone, for example, changes the scripts here but thinks the changes are innocuous when they aren't.",
